arguments.message:
Target 6 is incomplete. Container.Add(nil) defensive behavior is missing.

Current implementation in container.go appends nil without checking:
```go
func (c *Container) Add(add CanvasObject) {
	c.Objects = append(c.Objects, add)
	c.layout()
}
```

Required behavior: "Container.Add(nil) must be no-op (do not append nil to Objects)."

Please add a nil check before appending:
```go
func (c *Container) Add(add CanvasObject) {
	if add == nil {
		return
	}
	c.Objects = append(c.Objects, add)
	c.layout()
}
```
